IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0004.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PAY0004C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> OVERTIME PAY
    05 OVERTIME-PAY       PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 2000-OVERTIME
    DISPLAY "OVERTIME-PAY=" OVERTIME-PAY
    STOP RUN.
2000-OVERTIME.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> NO OVERTIME FOR CONTRACTORS
        WHEN EMP-CONTRACTOR
            MOVE 0.00 TO OVERTIME-PAY
        *> HEAVY OVERTIME
        WHEN HRS-WKD > 60
            COMPUTE OVERTIME-PAY = GROSS-PAY * 0.25
        *> STANDARD OVERTIME
        WHEN HRS-WKD > 40
            COMPUTE OVERTIME-PAY ROUNDED = GROSS-PAY * 0.15
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO OVERTIME-PAY
    END-EVALUATE.
